nvcomp-gui (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release (Closes: #XXXXXX)
  * Features:
    - GPU-accelerated compression with CUDA support
    - Qt6 graphical user interface
    - Command-line interface included
    - Multi-volume support for large files (2.5GB default)
    - Folder/directory compression
    - Desktop integration (MIME types, file associations)
    - File manager context menu support (Nautilus, Nemo)
    - Automatic GPU/CPU fallback
  * Supported algorithms:
    - LZ4 (fast, good ratio)
    - Zstd (best compression ratio)
    - Snappy (fastest)
    - GDeflate, ANS, Bitcomp (GPU-only)
  * Platform support:
    - Ubuntu 20.04 LTS, 22.04 LTS, 24.04 LTS
    - Debian 11 (Bullseye), 12 (Bookworm)
  * Dependencies:
    - Qt6 (6.2 or higher)
    - CUDA Toolkit 11.0+ (optional, recommended)
    - Standard C++ libraries
  * Documentation:
    - User manual included
    - Man pages for GUI and CLI
    - Example usage and tutorials

 -- nvCOMP Project <support@nvcomp.example.com>  Fri, 19 Dec 2025 12:00:00 +0000

